From d155897d15387fac7e7d2f0954faa427cd911aac Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sn3ro <zak.darek@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 18:54:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): the budget Set and the tool list Edit are in reach
 at 1280 x 720

The STEP facet budget label takes its own line, so Set stands inside the
Properties pane. The setup tool table gets a gutter for its floating
scroll bar, so a centre click on Edit after a scroll across reaches the
button. Delete operation is pinned inside the pane.

Pinned by layout_page_model, layout_page_operation and
a_centre_click_on_edit_opens_the_tool_after_a_scroll_across.

Fixes #1992

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
